/* Local Modification Log:
 * ----------------------
 *
 * .01  10-Sep-1997	Robert C. Sass (RCS)
 *                        Initialize Clock registers before epvxiResman is called.
 * .02  09-Sep-2003     Kristi Luchini (LUCHINI)
 *                        changed #if TARGET == MV2400 to #if CPU_FAMILY == PPC
 * .03  09-Sep-2003     Kristi Luchini (LUCHINI)
